&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;This position is paid a base wage plus incentive compensation. The base wage range for this position is targeted at $85,000.00 - $103,000.00 in our Miami office, and competitive On-Target Earnings, inclusive of incentive compensation, of *$170,000.00 - $206,000.00. Final offers may vary from those listed. *Incentive compensation is not guaranteed, and earning is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable incentive compensation plan.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
