&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are focused on and committed to helping people. You treat others with care and empathy, and assume the best intentions in others. You love to break down complicated concepts into simple terms and solve problems. You are a smart, motivated self-starter looking to learn a lot and join a fast growing company with a top notch culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Customer Support team at Justworks is in charge of leading all customer service inquiries, no matter how big or small. Our team represents all of Justworks, we take responsibility and ownership of our customer’s concerns, and we actively drive issues to resolution. We believe a positive team is the strongest unit, and we strive to make ourselves and each other better. We are the experts our customers rely on, and a crucial part of the overall Justworks service offering.&amp;nbsp; In this role you will support the worksite employees (WSEs) of our small business customers on a variety of inquiries related to timecards, paychecks, benefits, the Justworks product, and other HR related matters. This is a fast-paced and challenging role, but also incredibly rewarding due to the positive impact we have on our customers, their employees, and their businesses.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note: We are currently hiring for the shift schedule of Monday-Friday, 7am-4pm EST&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If hired, you will be expected to attend mandatory training [paid] from 9am-6pm EST Monday-Friday for approximately 4 weeks prior to moving over to your shift schedule.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage inbound inquiries from our small business customers’ employees via phone, email, or chat&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert-level support to customers around Justworks&#39; continually expanding product and service offerings including our software, benefits, payroll, compliance, and HR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist WSEs with eligibility and enrollment in benefits and perks including Medical, Dental, and Vision insurance, Life Insurance, Flexible Spending Accounts, Health Savings Accounts, commuter benefits, Long and Short Term Disability insurance, retirement and COBRA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve WSE inquiries related to their paycheck, time &amp;amp; attendance, tax withholdings, and tax documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain product expertise on our software and be the go-to resource for customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage open cases in our CRM to resolve inquiries in shortest possible time frame while keeping customers regularly informed of status and anticipated resolution timing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a sense of urgency to provide accurate information in a friendly, professional, and empathetic manner to create a white-glove customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure proper triage, escalation, and effective resolution of higher-level issues and challenging customer interactions through escalation to Team Leads or subject matter experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute recommendations for improving our product and processes while advocating for our customers and communicating bugs to engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Customer Support Advocate, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately result in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative &lt;/strong&gt;- takes an approach that focuses on building relationships with others, understanding their problems, and developing solutions to their challenges through open-ended questions and active listening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking responsibility &lt;/strong&gt;- being accountable, being committed, and accepting ownership for one&#39;s decisions, actions, and behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt; - the ability to adjust your approach or actions in response to changes in your external environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-oriented&lt;/strong&gt; - identifies the source of a question or challenge and provides the right, or a better, way of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious&lt;/strong&gt; - the innate desire to learn, grow and understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4 years minimum professional experience in customer service - preferably in B2B SaaS or contact center environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer service instincts and comfort handling challenging situations over the phone with the ability to be empathetic, compassionate, responsive and resourceful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for delighting customers and helping people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written (email and chat) and verbal (telephone) communication skills with acute attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aptitude for learning new products and helping to break down complicated topics and explain them in simple terms people can understand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to come up with creative solutions to any problem you face, and to know how to organize and prioritize your workload&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven self-starter, taking ownership and accountability over your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in SaaS, HR, payroll, PEOs, or health benefits a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spanish language capability, or other second language at business conversation level, a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-style: normal;&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $36.06 to $39.67 per hour.&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:33566973,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;6&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;7&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;8&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;9&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;10&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:10,&amp;quot;28&amp;quot;:1}&quot; data-sheets-formula=&quot;=concatenate(&amp;quot;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at &amp;quot;,TEXT(R[0]C[-2],&amp;quot;$#,##0.00&amp;quot;),&amp;quot; to &amp;quot;,TEXT(R[0]C[-1],&amp;quot;$#,##0.00&amp;quot;), &amp;quot; per &amp;quot;,(if(R[0]C[-4]=&amp;quot;Exempt&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;year.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;hour.&amp;quot;)))&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $26.44 to $31.25 per hour.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;#LI-Remote&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:277027,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16777215},&amp;quot;8&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:2236962},&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11,&amp;quot;21&amp;quot;:1}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot; data-sheets-value=&quot;{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;#LI-Hybrid&amp;quot;}&quot; data-sheets-userformat=&quot;{&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:277027,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0},&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:16777215},&amp;quot;8&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:[{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0}},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;:3},{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;:1}]},&amp;quot;12&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;14&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;:2236962},&amp;quot;15&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;16&amp;quot;:11,&amp;quot;21&amp;quot;:1}&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer expectations are evolving rapidly. Some customers want instant, AI-powered self-service. Others want trusted human expertise. We believe great customer support means meeting customers where they are—delivering the right experience through the right channel at the right moment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a hands-on builder who wants to help create that future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Customer Support Solutions Lead, you&#39;ll partner closely with the Senior Manager of Customer Support Operations &amp;amp; AI Transformation to turn strategy into execution. You&#39;ll design and build the systems, workflows, automations, and AI capabilities that power our Customer Support organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly hands-on individual contributor role. You&#39;ll work directly in our systems—configuring Zendesk, implementing and tuning AI servicing platforms, building automations, testing new technologies, and using what you learn to continuously improve how support works. As our support technology evolves, you&#39;ll also play an important role in modernizing our platform and helping execute future migrations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who can both design a better process and build the solution that makes it real.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build AI-Powered Support Experiences&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement, configure, and continuously optimize AI-powered customer support solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hands-on with AI servicing platforms such as Decagon, Intercom Fin, Sierra, Forethought, or similar technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and tune AI experiences, including intents, workflows, knowledge sources, escalation paths, guardrails, and human handoffs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design experiments, measure resolution and deflection performance, identify failure modes, and continuously improve AI effectiveness.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate emerging technologies and rapidly prototype new capabilities to determine where they can improve the customer or agent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong judgment about where automation should—and should not—be used, particularly in customer interactions where accuracy, complexity, or risk requires human expertise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Optimize Our Support Platform&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a hands-on expert in Zendesk, configuring and optimizing triggers, routing, business rules, queues, forms, integrations, permissions, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify and improve our existing Zendesk environment while ensuring it can support new AI and automation capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on the evolution of our support technology architecture, including evaluation and potential migration to a future support platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate future-state designs into implementation plans and execute the configuration, workflow development, testing, and rollout required to bring them to life.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure our support technology is scalable, reliable, and designed around both customer and agent needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design Better Ways of Working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map and redesign support processes to eliminate friction, unnecessary handoffs, and repetitive work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business problems into scalable workflows, systems, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look across the customer journey to identify where better process design or technology can improve the experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move comfortably from diagnosing a problem to designing a solution to building and implementing it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve solutions after launch based on performance, customer feedback, and frontline experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test, Learn and Iterate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach new solutions as products: define the problem, build a hypothesis, test it, measure the outcome, and iterate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Support leaders and frontline teams to understand where customers and agents experience friction.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use key Support metrics—including CSAT, resolution time, wait time, deflection, quality, and agent productivity—to identify opportunities, prioritize improvements, and measure whether new solutions are delivering better customer and business outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear success measures for AI, automation, and process changes and continuously optimize based on results.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across the Business&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product and Engineering to translate customer support needs into scalable technical solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Support leaders to understand business priorities, operational challenges, and opportunities to improve key Support outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Revenue Readiness to ensure new systems, workflows, and AI capabilities are effectively introduced and adopted by frontline teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Revenue Operations, Customer Success, Data, and other teams to improve experiences that span the broader customer journey.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with technology partners and vendors to evaluate, implement, and optimize new capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring customer and agent insights back to Product and Technology teams to influence future improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated hands-on experience implementing and optimizing AI-powered customer support solutions. You&#39;ve personally configured, launched, tuned, and measured AI servicing experiences—not simply managed a vendor or overseen an implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands-on Zendesk administration experience, including triggers, routing, business rules, workflows, integrations, permissions, and reporting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with one or more AI customer servicing platforms such as Decagon, Intercom Fin, Sierra, Forethought, or similar technologies.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success designing and implementing operational workflows and process improvements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automations and configuring or integrating business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of customer support operations and the judgment to determine when automation improves an experience and when human intervention is the better solution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using data to diagnose problems, prioritize opportunities, and measure the effectiveness of solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering closely with Product and Engineering teams to deliver new capabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working as a hands-on individual contributor who can independently take a problem from discovery through implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity about emerging technology and a bias toward experimentation, learning, and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating from Zendesk to Salesforce Service Cloud or another enterprise customer support platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in complex or high-stakes customer service environments where accuracy and appropriate escalation are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI servicing platforms with CRM, support, knowledge management, and other customer-facing systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;re a Builder-Operator If You...&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy designing better ways of working and then rolling up your sleeves to build them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;d rather prototype a solution than spend weeks writing requirements for someone else to implement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can move fluidly between a customer problem, a process problem, and a technical solution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re comfortable getting deep into system configuration while still understanding the business outcome you&#39;re trying to achieve.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don&#39;t automate for automation&#39;s sake—you know that the best solution may be AI, traditional automation, better process design, or a human.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You experiment, measure, learn, and iterate rather than assuming the first solution is the final one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get excited about emerging technology but care even more about whether it actually makes the customer experience better.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The future of Customer Support isn&#39;t a choice between technology and people. It&#39;s about designing an experience that uses each where they add the most value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI capabilities and customer expectations continue to evolve, we&#39;re building a support model that can meet customers in different ways—from intelligent self-service and automation to trusted human expertise.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working alongside the Senior Manager of Customer Support Operations &amp;amp; AI Transformation, you&#39;ll be one of the people who makes that vision real. You&#39;ll build the systems, workflows, automations, and AI experiences that define the next generation of Customer Support at Justworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $121,000.00 to $151,000.00 per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-AM2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI Tools.&lt;/strong&gt; We may use artificial intelligence and other automated tools to process your personal information as part of the recruitment process. For example, we may use these tools to record, transcribe, and summarize interviews, to help organize and review applications, and to help us assess candidates by comparing their skills, experience, and qualifications against the criteria for open roles. These tools support, but do not replace, human review. We do not make hiring decisions based solely on automated processing, and all final hiring decisions are made by Justworks recruiters and hiring managers. Depending on where you reside, you may have rights regarding our use of automated tools. For more information, please contact us at &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:privacy@justworks.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Justworks, we help small businesses confidently navigate the complexities of running a business—from payroll and benefits to HR, compliance, and workforce management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More small business owners are beginning their Justworks journey digitally. Many can evaluate and purchase Justworks through Self-Service. Others reach a point where having a knowledgeable person available can make the difference between getting stuck and confidently moving forward.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That’s where Digital Sales comes in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Sales Advisor&lt;/strong&gt;, you will work with small business owners and administrators who are already engaging with Justworks digitally and where human guidance can help them take the next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional lead qualification role, and you won’t spend your day collecting information so someone else can sell to the customer. It also isn’t an order-taking role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will quickly understand what the customer is trying to accomplish, determine what is preventing them from moving forward, and take action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sometimes that means answering a benefits or payroll question and helping the customer continue through Self-Service. Sometimes it means helping them compare options, configure the right Justworks solution, and owning the sale through close. And sometimes it means recognizing that the customer’s needs require deeper expertise and making a seamless transition to Managed Sales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your job is simple: &lt;strong&gt;make it easier for small businesses to confidently choose and buy Justworks.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with small business owners and administrators who have demonstrated interest or intent through the Justworks digital buying experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer and behavioral signals to prioritize where your time and expertise can have the greatest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quickly understand customer readiness, needs, urgency, and complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct focused discovery that gets to the customer’s real question without unnecessarily extending the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise customers across common payroll, benefits, HR, compliance, and workforce questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers understand which Justworks products best fit their needs and identify opportunities to sell the broader platform where appropriate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain pricing and value clearly and confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the alternatives customers are considering and position Justworks effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle objections and confidently ask for the business when the customer is ready to buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work alongside customers to complete important steps rather than simply giving them another list of things to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own appropriate opportunities through conversion and create a smooth transition into onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve discrete questions or blockers and help customers continue through Self-Service when that is the best experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when customer complexity warrants Managed Sales and make a seamless, context-rich transition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when a customer has genuine future potential but isn’t ready to buy today and move them into the appropriate nurture experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and automation to prepare for conversations, understand customer context, complete follow-up, and minimize administrative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture clean customer signals and outcomes so we can continuously improve how customers buy Justworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share recurring customer questions, objections, and friction with the teams improving our digital and Self-Service experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in experiments around customer signals, timing, messaging, sales plays, and workflows—and help us understand what actually improves customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be consultative and commercial.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t read a script or run every customer through the same discovery process. You listen, diagnose, advise, and sell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create momentum.&lt;/strong&gt; Every customer interaction should move the buying journey forward with a clear outcome and next step.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use judgment.&lt;/strong&gt; You know when to sell, when to solve the immediate problem, when to bring in deeper expertise, and when a customer simply isn’t ready yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do the work with the customer.&lt;/strong&gt; If helping a customer work through a quote, understand a contribution model, complete an application, or navigate another step gets them unstuck, you lean in and help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn broadly.&lt;/strong&gt; Small business owners don’t organize their questions around our internal teams. You develop enough knowledge across Justworks’ products to understand the problem, answer common questions, and get customers to the right outcome quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace technology.&lt;/strong&gt; AI and automation are core to how this team operates. You use them to eliminate administrative work and spend more time helping customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experiment and improve.&lt;/strong&gt; Digital Sales is a new motion. You will help us test and improve how we engage customers, and some of the work you do today may eventually become automated or built directly into the product. That’s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a quota-carrying sales or other customer-facing commercial role; experience in high-velocity SMB, inbound, digital, or product-led sales is especially relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to understand customer needs and translate them into a clear recommendation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and comfort advising small business owners and decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial instinct—you recognize buying signals, can handle objections, and are comfortable asking for the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn products quickly and explain complex concepts simply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bias toward action and a willingness to work alongside customers to solve problems and keep them moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and follow-through in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using CRM systems, customer data, AI, and automation as part of your daily workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious, adaptable, and energized by helping build something new.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payroll, benefits, HR, PEO, fintech, SaaS, or SMB customers is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work from our Phoenix office as part of an in-person team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid #LI-KH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Department&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Finance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Corporate Accounting&lt;/strong&gt; to lead the controllership function at Justworks through our next phase of scale, complexity, and global expansion. In this role, you’ll be responsible for the integrity of our general ledger, the effectiveness of our internal controls, and the accuracy and timeliness of financial data that supports audit, compliance, and internal reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will oversee global accounting teams and partner closely with key stakeholders across FP&amp;amp;A, Internal Audit, Legal, Product, and Engineering, among others. Your focus will be on building a strong foundation of accounting policies, process integrity, and audit readiness — with a clear mandate to scale these systems in a high-growth, SEC-ready environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Controllership &amp;amp; Close&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and lead the month-end and quarter-end close process, with accountability for timely, accurate completion across all domestic and international entities through effective team oversight, review, and escalation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set and maintain standards for the global chart of accounts and GL policy framework, ensuring consistency, compliance, and alignment with US GAAP as the business evolves.&lt;br&gt;Oversee and review accounting outcomes across key balance sheet areas, including accrued liabilities, payroll, benefits passthroughs, and intercompany activity, ensuring appropriate judgment and documentation are applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Accounting (AP, T&amp;amp;E, Cash)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide leadership and direction over the Accounts Payable function, ensuring strong controls, clear ownership, and efficient execution across vendor onboarding, invoice processing, approvals, and payments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish and enforce corporate T&amp;amp;E policies and spend management practices, partnering with stakeholders to drive compliance, transparency, and operational clarity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Oversee daily corporate cash activity and related reconciliations, working closely with Treasury and the accounting team to ensure accuracy, liquidity visibility, and strong control practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Audit, Controls &amp;amp; Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead and coordinate internal and external audit interactions for controllership-owned areas, ensuring teams are prepared, documentation is complete, and issues are identified and resolved proactively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, implement, and continuously improve scalable internal controls and approval frameworks across close, AP, and expense processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the development and governance of global accounting policies, including review and approval of accounting treatment for new products, cross-border activity, and non-routine transactions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Global Coordination&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Directly manage and develop a global accounting team, setting clear expectations around ownership, quality, and accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build a culture of excellence grounded in accuracy, judgment, continuous improvement, and professional growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure the team has the structure, tools, and guidance needed to support entity-level closes, intercompany accounting, statutory requirements, and coordination with local advisors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional &amp;amp; Strategic Partnership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as the accounting leader and thought partner to FP&amp;amp;A, Tax, Legal, Product, and other stakeholders by proactively assessing and advising on accounting implications of business decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner with Product and Engineering leaders to influence upstream system design and data integrity, improving downstream close quality and audit readiness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Support SOX-readiness and control maturity efforts by establishing clear process ownership, review standards, and scalable control documentation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Director, Corporate Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is just as important as &lt;em&gt;what&lt;/em&gt; is achieved. Your ability to lead and operate effectively at scale will be grounded in the following core competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic precision&lt;/strong&gt; – combines exceptional attention to detail with an understanding of the broader business context; ensures accuracy while aligning financial processes and policies with organizational goals and cross-functional needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ethical leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – models integrity, transparency, and accountability; sets the tone for financial stewardship and ensures that accounting practices align with both regulatory standards and company values.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive communication&lt;/strong&gt; – conveys complex financial and operational concepts clearly and credibly across all levels of the organization, adapting communication styles to suit diverse stakeholders, from executive leadership to auditors to business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Structured analytical thinking&lt;/strong&gt; – applies a data-driven and systems-oriented mindset to assess and improve financial workflows; anticipates downstream impacts and proactively identifies issues, risks, and opportunities across a fast-moving, high-volume environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sound judgment and decision-making&lt;/strong&gt; – exercises professional skepticism, weighs competing priorities and risks, and makes timely, informed decisions; demonstrates ownership and follow-through while fostering a culture of thoughtful accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of progressive accounting experience, including 5+ years in a senior leadership or controllership role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CPA required; public accounting + in-house controllership (ideally in high-growth or global environments) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of US GAAP and accounting operations; strong experience in AP, T&amp;amp;E, and cash reconciliations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading international teams and multi-entity accounting structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems orientation — NetSuite, FloQast, and experience with close acceleration tools a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City office is targeted at $198,000.00 - $237,600.00 per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-DG2 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
