&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary advisor for complex international compliance requirements in the Americas, providing strategic recommendations on cross-border employment nuances, terminations, and local labor standards to mitigate global risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal, Product, and Operations to interpret global industry trends and regulatory shifts, directly influencing international product-market fit and go-to-market strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success to manage high-value accounts, addressing sophisticated, Americas-specific needs that require advanced jurisdictional expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the final point of internal escalation for inquiries that cross into complex compliance or high-liability HR territory, such as intricate leave scenarios and country-specific benefits in the Americas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify EOR expansion and upsell opportunities, guiding customers through the strategic complexities of entering and scaling in new international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive retention and growth of existing customer base through an education-based approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex international regulations and processes into clear, actionable guidance for customers and internal partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate independently while contributing to team knowledge and scaling best practices across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilize deep global knowledge to advise customers on legally sensitive and region-specific paths forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the voice of the specialized customer to ensure Justworks’ international infrastructure meets the needs of complex, multinational organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as needed based on departmental/organizational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an International Consultant, how results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately result in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative &lt;/strong&gt;- Takes an approach that focuses on building relationships with others, understanding their problems, and developing solutions to their challenges through open-ended questions and active listening.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taking responsibility &lt;/strong&gt;- Being accountable, being committed, and accepting ownership for one&#39;s decisions, actions, and behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability&lt;/strong&gt; - The ability to adjust your approach or actions in response to changes in your internal and external environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution-oriented &lt;/strong&gt;- Identifies the source of a question or challenge and provides the right, or a better, way of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Curious &lt;/strong&gt;- The innate desire to learn, grow and understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as COGIS. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in a customer-facing international HR role, ideally with deep expertise in the EOR space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing strategic conversations and complex global customer HR scenarios with minimum of 2 years managing complex customer-facing issues in EOR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, problem-solving, and consultative skills, with the ability to convey complex concepts clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of HR technology and international employment compliance across the Americas (LATAM, Canada, etc)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating with multiple internal stakeholders to drive customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to multiple countries/regions is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JIRA, Zendesk, and Notion is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multilingual fluency is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The base salary range for this position, based in our Mexico City office, is MXN 72,833–91,083 per month.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-MM3 &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you have a passion for shaping organizations, developing talent, and creating systems that enable people and businesses to perform at their highest potential? Are you energized by solving complex organizational challenges and designing the future of work in an AI-enabled environment?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Justworks is seeking a strategic and innovative &lt;strong&gt;Lead, Organizational Design &amp;amp; Talent Management&lt;/strong&gt; to help shape how our organization evolves as work, technology, and business continue to change. This role will lead the evolution of our organizational design, talent management, and performance management practices, helping Justworks transition from traditional, role-based structures to dynamic, capability-based organizations that combine human judgment with AI-enabled execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an internal expert in organizational design and organizational effectiveness, you will help leaders think differently about how work gets done by reimagining operating models, decision making, workforce capabilities, and the interaction between people and AI. Your work will ensure our organization continues to scale with clarity, agility, and organizational leverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Director, Talent &amp;amp; Organizational Development (TOD).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Organizational Design for an AI-Enabled Workforce&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design future-state organizations that thoughtfully integrate AI-enabled workflows, automation, and human-AI collaboration while improving organizational effectiveness, speed, and decision quality in close partnership with the Director, TOD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead organizational design initiatives that align business strategy, operating models, talent, and workforce capabilities by partnering with our Business/Functional Leaders and People Business Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move organizational design beyond reporting structures by shaping how work flows across the organization, including:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workflow design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Decision-rights architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team interfaces and operating rhythms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Human and AI role orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic workforce planning efforts by translating business strategy into future workforce capability, organizational design, and talent requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Organizational &amp;amp; Talent Review Processes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise Organizational &amp;amp; Talent Reviews (OTRs) that align business strategy, organizational design, workforce planning, and talent decisions in close partnership with the Director, TOD.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive talent segmentation, critical role identification, and succession planning processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Business Partners and leaders to assess organizational health, talent risks, and future capability needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build actionable development and succession plans for key talent populations and strengthen leadership accountability for talent development and succession readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve Career Growth Through Skills-Based Talent Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the evolution of the Justworks Career Journey (JCJ) framework from a role-based model to a skills- and capability-based architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Total Rewards to continuously align our JCJ framework and job architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across People, Technology, and business functions to identify critical future skills required in an AI-enabled workplace.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design frameworks that increase transparency into career growth opportunities and support internal mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Performance Management Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evolve performance management practices to reflect changing business needs, AI-enabled ways of working, and a culture of continuous growth, accountability, and high performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead company-wide goal-setting, performance review cycles, calibration processes, and talent assessment discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Explore how AI can improve the quality, consistency, and effectiveness of performance conversations while keeping human judgment at the center of talent decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build manager capability in feedback, coaching, performance conversations, and talent evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders to reinforce a culture of accountability, continuous feedback, and high performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Data-Informed Talent Decisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage talent analytics, workforce insights, and predictive indicators to inform organizational and talent decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor talent health metrics including succession readiness, internal mobility, performance distribution, promotion effectiveness, and retention of key talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People Analytics to identify trends and provide recommendations that improve organizational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact and effectiveness of talent and performance management systems and continuously improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as a Strategic Organizational Effectiveness Consultant&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to leaders on organizational effectiveness, workforce design, talent strategy, and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose organizational challenges and recommend scalable solutions that balance business outcomes and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead change management efforts associated with new organizational structures, talent practices, and performance systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence stakeholders across all levels of the organization to drive adoption and sustained behavior change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the TOD portfolio of work across Leadership Development, Learning &amp;amp; Development and Engagement, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Lead, Organizational Design &amp;amp; Talent Management&lt;/strong&gt;,&amp;nbsp; how results are achieved is paramount to your success and ultimately our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities, and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems Thinking&lt;/strong&gt; – Understands how talent, structure, processes, technology, and business strategy interact to drive organizational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consultative Partnership&lt;/strong&gt; – Builds trusted relationships and develops practical solutions through influence and collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational Effectiveness Expertise&lt;/strong&gt; – Applies deep expertise in organizational design, talent management, workforce planning, and performance systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; – Connects current challenges with future business needs and anticipates organizational implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Change Champion&lt;/strong&gt; – Drives adoption of new systems, behaviors, and ways of working in a rapidly evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Decision Making&lt;/strong&gt; – Uses qualitative and quantitative insights to inform decisions and improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nimble Learning&lt;/strong&gt; – Learns quickly, experiments thoughtfully, and adapts effectively to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers align their behaviors to our COGIS values: Camaraderie, Openness, Grit, Integrity, and Simplicity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in organizational development, organizational design, talent management, workforce planning, performance management, or related disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in high-growth, technology, or rapidly evolving business environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated expertise leading talent review, succession planning, talent segmentation, and performance management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing organizational structures, operating models, or workforce planning solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how AI, automation, and emerging technologies are reshaping workforce design and talent practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and implementing scalable talent and performance management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence senior leaders and drive organizational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience leveraging workforce and talent data to drive decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional facilitation, communication, and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage complex cross-functional initiatives from strategy through execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong intellectual curiosity, growth mindset, and commitment to continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to fostering inclusive talent systems and integrating DEIB principles throughout organizational and talent practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our New York City headquarters. The base wage range for this position will be $166,000 - $214,000 annually.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SD1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team / Technology Strategy &amp;amp; Operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Program Management function plays a vital role in keeping Justworks’ Technology Division – comprising Product, Design, Engineering, and Data – focused and connected. We connect dots and break silos across teams by maintaining an effective operating cadence, managing strategic initiatives, and leading special projects that help translate strategy into execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re excited by the idea of leading initiatives across the organization and driving impact. Everything you deliver is backed by a solid strategy. You maintain confidence throughout all your projects and are committed to getting things done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Program Manager within the Technology team, you will work closely with Product, Design, Engineering, Data, and Operations to accelerate the delivery of high-impact initiatives that are critical to driving our strategy and alignment with company goals. You will drive product initiatives forward that have multiple stakeholders, competing deadlines, and many moving parts. In this role, you’ll act as a bridge between functions and teams, developing frameworks that streamline program execution, optimize resource allocation, and drive accountability across initiatives across multiple product domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technology and Business leaders to identify, assess, and shape high-priority initiatives before formal program investment decisions are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery efforts to determine whether emerging initiatives require dedicated program management support, lightweight operating structures, or alternative execution models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish program foundations for newly formed initiatives, including governance structures, operating rhythms, stakeholder alignment models, success metrics, and execution frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a senior program leadership resource across the Technology portfolio, deploying into high-priority, high-risk, or complex initiatives to accelerate progress, stabilize execution, or unblock delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multiple concurrent programs and advisory engagements spanning Product, Engineering, Design, Data, Operations, and other cross-functional business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess program health across the portfolio, identifying systemic risks, execution gaps, organizational dependencies, and opportunities to improve outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement repeatable program management standards, frameworks, and operating mechanisms that improve execution quality across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach program managers and cross-functional leaders on program management practices, stakeholder alignment, governance design, risk management, and organizational change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Program Management leadership to evolve portfolio management practices, resource planning approaches, staffing models, and program intake processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate executive-level decision-making by synthesizing complex information, framing tradeoffs, and providing recommendations on prioritization, sequencing, and investment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive turnaround efforts for programs requiring intervention, including clarifying ownership, resetting plans, rebuilding stakeholder alignment, and restoring execution momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve organizational effectiveness through better operating models, scalable mechanisms, automation, AI-enabled workflows, and durable systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable playbooks, templates, frameworks, and knowledge assets that raise the effectiveness of the broader Program Management function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Program Manager, &lt;em&gt;how&lt;/em&gt; results are achieved is paramount for your success and ultimately result in our success as an organization. In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, abilities and personal attributes are anchored in the following competencies:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer focus &lt;/strong&gt;- builds strong customer relationships and delivers customer-centric solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork and communication &lt;/strong&gt;- putting our collective best together through documentation, collaboration, relationship-building, listening, empathy, recruiting, and evangelism.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nimble learning &lt;/strong&gt;- actively learning through experimentation when tackling new problems, using both successes and failures as learning fodder.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-driven &lt;/strong&gt;- consistently achieves results, even under difficult circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic mindset &lt;/strong&gt;- anticipates future trends and implications accurately; articulates credible pictures and visions of possibilities that will create sustainable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-oriented &lt;/strong&gt;- exercises extreme attention to detail; is thorough, accurate, organized, and productive and seeks to understand both the cause and effect of a situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ethical practice &lt;/strong&gt;- the ability to integrate core values, integrity, and accountability throughout all organizational and business practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication &lt;/strong&gt;- the ability to articulate thoughts and express ideas effectively using oral, written, visual, and non-verbal communication skills, as well as listening skills to gain understanding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical &lt;/strong&gt;- uses a logical reasoning process to break down and work through a situation or problem to arrive at an outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good judgment &lt;/strong&gt;- the exercise of critical thinking, analyzing and assessing problems and implications, identifying patterns, making connections of underlying issues, understanding risks and developing mitigation strategies, and taking ownership of the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, all Justworkers focus on aligning their behaviors to our core values known as &lt;strong&gt;COGIS&lt;/strong&gt;. It stands for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie&lt;/strong&gt; - Day to day you can be seen working together toward a higher purpose. You like to have fun. You’re an active listener, treat people respectfully, and have a strong desire to know and help others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Openness&lt;/strong&gt; - Your default is to be open. You&#39;re willing to share information, understand other perspectives, and consider new possibilities. You’re curious, ask open questions, and are receptive to thoughts and feedback from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grit &lt;/strong&gt;- You demonstrate grit by having the courage to commit and persevere. You’re committed, earnest, and dive in to get the job done well with a positive attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integrity&lt;/strong&gt; - Simply put, do what you say and say what you&#39;ll do. You’re honest and forthright, have a strong moral compass, and strive to match your words with your actions while leading by example.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Simplicity&lt;/strong&gt; - Be like Einstein: “Everything should be made as simple as possible, but no simpler.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8+ years of experience in strategy, operations, management consulting, program management, product operations, business operations, or a related cross-functional leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading highly ambiguous, cross-functional initiatives that span multiple teams, organizations, or business functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate emerging strategies, executive priorities, or loosely defined opportunities into actionable plans, operating models, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to evaluate organizational tradeoffs, investment decisions, operating models, and long-term strategic implications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional systems thinker who can identify patterns, dependencies, organizational friction points, and opportunities for leverage across complex environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence senior leaders and executive stakeholders without direct authority, driving alignment across competing priorities and perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing structure where little exists, including defining ownership models, governance mechanisms, decision-making frameworks, and operating rhythms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical fluency and curiosity, with the ability to quickly develop expertise in new domains, technologies, products, and business models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to synthesize complex information into clear recommendations for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative systems thinker who thrives in ambiguity, demonstrates strong judgment, and has a passion for simplifying complexity and accelerating organizational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base wage range for this position based in our New York City Office is targeted at $188,000.00 - $242,000.00 per year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Manager, Account Executives - Sales, you are the primary engine of our high-growth Account Executive organization. You are a dependable, natural leader who doesn’t just manage a team—you build a winning culture. You are a master of sales fundamentals, a data-driven coach who lives in the numbers, and a &quot;player-coach&quot; who knows how to move the needle on complex deals. You thrive in the weeds of pipeline mechanics and are obsessed with iterating on processes to drive elite performance. This is the foundational leadership role that prepares you to scale into regional management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team Operating System (Meetings &amp;amp; Leadership)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own the daily and weekly rhythm of your team, ensuring every AE is aligned and empowered:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coaching &amp;amp; Performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead high-impact weekly 1:1s with AEs focused on skill development and career progression; deliver rigorous performance reviews and implement development plans with precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Schedule and lead high-energy team meetings that translate high-level company goals into actionable daily tactics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Train your team on the Justworks sales methodology, ensuring every rep is a consultant-level expert in our product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline Integrity &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the &quot;Single Source of Truth&quot; for your team’s funnel and forecasting accuracy:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Rigor &amp;amp; Gong:&lt;/strong&gt; Use Gong and Salesforce data to diagnose performance gaps, provide real-time coaching, and ensure your team’s activity translates into revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Enforce flawless CRM hygiene; you ensure that stages, close dates, and deal categories are accurate, providing the clean data the Senior Manager needs for regional forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metric Tracking:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively track and report on team KPIs, identifying trends before they become problems and iterating on outbound strategies to fuel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing &amp;amp; Commercial Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the tactical lead ensuring your team wins the &quot;War Room&quot; deals:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Attach yourself to key opportunities, coaching AEs through the finish line of complex PEO and International negotiations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resource Leverage:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide your team in effectively utilizing specialists (Underwriting, Finance, Legal) to maximize conversion rates and shorten sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Motivation:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with leadership to design and execute sales contests and motivational initiatives that drive &quot;Grit&quot; and healthy competition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Talent Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the face of Justworks values for our frontline contributors:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Acquisition:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the initial stages of the interview loop; hire high-performing salespeople who align with COGIS values and possess the drive to exceed targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engagement &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Embody company culture daily, maintaining high employee engagement and fostering a supportive, &quot;work hard/play hard&quot; environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DEIB Champion:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a strong driver for DEIB initiatives, ensuring diverse perspectives are recruited, heard, and developed within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, your foundational knowledge, skills, and personal attributes are anchored in the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good judgment&lt;/strong&gt; – the exercise of critical thinking, identifying patterns in team performance, and taking ownership of the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Detail-oriented&lt;/strong&gt; – exercises extreme attention to detail in deal mechanics and data reporting; seeks to understand both the cause and effect of sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Results-driven&lt;/strong&gt; – consistently achieves revenue targets, even under difficult market circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foundational Sales Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; – expert-level mastery of prospecting, cold calling, negotiating, and closing to lead by example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communication&lt;/strong&gt; – the ability to simplify complex HR/Tax concepts for the team and articulate team needs upward to Senior Leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Core Values (COGIS):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Camaraderie, Openness, Grit, Integrity, and Simplicity.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Minimum of 3+ years in a sales representative role (Human Capital Management/PEO preferred) and 2+ years of prior management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficient in Salesforce, Gong, LinkedIn Sales Navigator, and SalesLoft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of managing a team of at least 4+ people to quota attainment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive:&lt;/strong&gt; A &quot;lead-from-the-front&quot; mentality with the ability to dive into a cold call one minute and analyze a performance dashboard the next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is paid a base wage plus incentive compensation. The base wage range for this position is targeted at $144,615.00 - $159,077.00 in the state of California, and competitive On-Target Earnings, inclusive of incentive compensation, of *$247,215.00 - $269,077.00. Final offers may vary from those listed. *Incentive compensation is not guaranteed, and earning is subject to the terms and conditions of the applicable incentive compensation plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;#LI-BF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;For more information about Justworks’ Total Reward Philosophy, including all of the perks and benefits we are proud to offer our team members, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#total-reward-philosophy&quot;&gt;Total Rewards @ Justworks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity At Justworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Justworks is committed to maintaining a workplace where diversity of identity, culture, and life experience is the norm and is celebrated authentically and respected consistently. Diversity in our work, our people, and our product drives creativity and innovation, entrepreneurial leadership and integrity, competitiveness, and collaboration throughout our business and in the market. We depend on our differences to make our team stronger, our workplace more dynamic, and our product accessible to all of our customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer open to all qualified applicants regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital or familial status, disability, pregnancy, gender identity or expression, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status. Justworks is fully dedicated to providing necessary support to candidates with disabilities who may require reasonable accommodations. We also provide reasonable accommodations to employees based on their sincerely held religious beliefs, as well as for other covered reasons consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws. If you&#39;re in need of a reasonable accommodation, please reach out to us at &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations@justworks.com&quot;&gt;accommodations@justworks.com&lt;/a&gt;. Your comfort and success matter to us, and we&#39;re here to ensure an inclusive experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/press/company-news/justworks-impact-report-2024&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our DEIB Report&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Justworks, you’ll enjoy a welcoming and casual environment, great benefits, wellness program offerings, company retreats, and the ability to interact with and learn from leaders in the startup community. We work hard and care about our most prized asset - our people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re helping businesses get off the ground by enabling them to focus on running their business. We solve HR issues. We’re data-driven and never stop iterating. If you’d like to work in a supportive, entrepreneurial environment, are interested in building something meaningful and having fun while doing it, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re united by shared goals and shared motivations at Justworks. These are best summed up in our company values, which are reflected in our product and in our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.justworks.com/careers#values&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our Values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If this sounds like you, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Digital Sales&lt;/strong&gt; to build and lead this new commercial motion from our Phoenix office.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a builder role. You will lead a team of Digital Sales Advisors responsible for converting high-intent small business customers while also helping design and continuously improve the system around them—including customer signals, routing, sales plays, workflows, automation, experimentation, and feedback into our Self-Service experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for revenue and conversion, but this role is broader than managing a sales number. You will constantly evaluate why customers need human help, which interventions improve outcomes, what our Advisors should do differently, and which interactions we can eventually eliminate through better product experiences, signals, or automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The right leader combines strong commercial judgment with systems thinking. You are equally comfortable coaching a seller through a customer conversation, analyzing funnel performance, designing an experiment, and partnering with Product or GTM Engineering to improve how customers buy Justworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Success Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Work On&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, launch, and lead Justworks’ Digital Sales team in Phoenix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the team’s performance across conversion, bookings, sales velocity, product adoption, and seller productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard, coach, and develop Digital Sales Advisors who can quickly diagnose customer needs, provide focused consultation, handle objections, and confidently close business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and continuously improve sales plays based on customer behavior, seller performance, and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer, product, and behavioral signals to improve how we identify where human intervention is most likely to change the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and run experiments across customer populations, intervention points, messaging, channels, sales plays, and routing approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a disciplined operating cadence to understand where customers are getting stuck, which interventions are working, and where the motion needs to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Revenue Effectiveness, Product, Marketing, and Analytics to improve the overall digital buying journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM Engineering to automate administrative work and use AI to increase seller capacity and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate recurring customer questions, objections, and friction into opportunities to improve Product, Self-Service, marketing, and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage staffing and capacity dynamically as customer demand, acquisition channels, product complexity, and Self-Service capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong operating discipline around customer dispositions and CRM data so frontline interactions generate useful signals for the broader business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships across Self-Service, Managed Sales, Product, Marketing, Revenue Operations, Revenue Readiness, Analytics, and GTM Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Will Do Your Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think in systems.&lt;/strong&gt; You look beyond an individual seller or customer interaction to understand the signals, processes, technology, incentives, and customer experiences producing the outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build, measure, and learn.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable starting with a hypothesis, launching a strong first version, measuring what happens, and changing the model based on evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to customers.&lt;/strong&gt; You use data, but you also listen to calls, observe seller behavior, and understand what small business owners and administrators are actually trying to accomplish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automate aggressively.&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t assume increasing demand requires increasing headcount. You continuously look for work that can be standardized, automated, or solved through a better digital experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize for the customer journey.&lt;/strong&gt; Success is not maximizing the amount of work Digital Sales owns. Sometimes the best outcome is closing the customer. Sometimes it is helping them continue through Self-Service, routing them to Managed Sales, or recognizing that they simply aren’t ready yet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a high-velocity sales team, ideally serving SMB customers in a digital, product-led, or inbound sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of coaching consultative selling, objection handling, and closing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or materially improving a sales motion, rather than only operating an established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical orientation and comfort using funnel, product, and customer data to make operating decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to test new approaches, learn from customer behavior, and translate insights into changes in sales execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Systems thinker who can connect customer behavior, process, technology, data, and seller execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with Revenue Operations, Product, Marketing, Analytics, and/or Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of how AI and automation can improve customer experiences and seller productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and changing processes quickly as new information emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with payroll, benefits, HR technology, PEO, fintech, SaaS, or another complex SMB product is helpful but not required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to work from our Phoenix office as part of an in-person team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KH1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Actual compensation is based on multiple factors that are unique to each candidate, including and not limited to skill set, level of relevant experience, and specific work location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Salary ranges for positions based in other locations may differ based on the cost of labor in that location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
